title: Remove the stale pallet-people and pallet-dummy-dim crates
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    Per gui1117 on #13513: pallet-people's development continued in paritytech/individuality-community, nothing in this repo or in polkadot-fellows/runtimes depends on it anymore (People Polkadot pulls `indiv-pallet-people`/`indiv-pallet-people-lite` from that repo instead). `pallet-dummy-dim` only existed to depend on `pallet-people` and has no other dependents.

    Removes both crates entirely rather than just flagging them stale, since nothing uses them. `cargo metadata`, `zepter run check`, and `cargo check -p polkadot-sdk` all pass clean after the removal.

    Closes #13513
crates: []
